# Clishortener (WIP)
## Easily shorten links with different services all in one cli tool

## Installation
install using pip
```bash
pip install Clishortener
```
or install from source using git
```bash
git clone (url)
cd Clishortener
```

## Usage
```bash
cshorten url [flags]
```

## Services

| Service | Identifier | Requires key | Homepage |
|---------|---------------|--------------|----------|
| tinyurl | tinyurl-auth / tinyurl-noauth | ✓/X | [Click here](https://tinyurl.com/)|
| is\.gd   | isgd | X | [Click Here](https://is.gd/index.php) |
| v\.gd     | vgd  | X | [Click here](https://v.gd/) |
| da\.gd    | dagd | X | [Click here](https://da.gd) |
| cleanuri | cleanuri | X | [Click here](https://cleanuri.com/) |
| ulvis   | ulvis | X | [Click here](https://ulvis.net/) |
| short\.io | shortio | ✓ | [Click here](https://short.io/) |
| clck\.ru   | clckru | X | [Click here](https://clck.ru) |
| bit\.ly   | bitly | ✓ | [Click here](https://bitly.com/) |
| cutt\.ly  | cuttly | ✓ | [Click here](https://cutt.ly/) |
| YOURLS | yourls | ✓/X | [Click here](https://yourls.org/) |
| Custom | custom | ✓/X | None |

## Flags

| Flag | Long Flag | Purpose | Usage Example |
|------|-----------|---------|---------------|
## Additional information
- Default url shortening service is tinyurl (no key / anonymous)
- Identifier is used when specifying a specific link shortening service with -s or -d
- YOURLS is selfhosted only
- Custom & YOURLS allows any url to be used
- When using Custom or YOURLS use the full url
